{"title":"我会副会长兼秘书长单位——广州大学建筑设计研究院有限公司邀工程实例专委会主任委员竺维彬进行技术、管理心得交流","date":"2024-07-09","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">我会副会长兼秘书长单位</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&mdash;&mdash;<span style=\"letter-spacing:.4pt\">广州大学建筑设计研究院有限公司邀工程实例专委会主任委员竺维彬进行技术、管理心得交流</span></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">6</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">14</span>日下午，中国岩石力学与工程学会工程实例专委会主任委员、广州轨道交通盾构技术研究所首席专家、广州地铁原常务副总经理竺维彬受邀到我会副会长兼秘书长单位广州大学建筑设计研究院有限公司进行技术、管理心得交流。勘察设计大师林本海教授、副院长唐仁、林宗涛等共<span lang=\"EN-US\">30</span>余名骨干工程师参加了交流。工程实例专委会秘书长米晋生一同参加交流。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:华文中宋\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/741.jpg\" style=\"width: 1280px; height: 730px;\" /><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:red\">现场交流<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">交流会上，竺总首先感谢林本海大师团队长期以来对广州地铁风险控制和广州等城市地下空间开发安全发展做出的贡献。随后，以&ldquo;地下工事反思心悟&rdquo;为题，将自己从事地下工事<span lang=\"EN-US\">40</span>余年的心得，从地下工事<span lang=\"EN-US\">/</span>地下空间开发的意义、地下工事面临的问题或挑战、现代地下工事的风险控制思想、地下工事风险控制原则、地下工事风险和事故案例以及展望等六个方面，结合哲学、文化思想进行了深入浅出的交流讨论。现场频频互动、气氛活跃。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:\r\n115%;font-family:华文中宋\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/852.jpg\" style=\"width: 1280px; height: 754px;\" /><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">竺总强调：地下是城市的最后疆域，是未来城市不可或缺的重要组成部分。开发的宗旨是服务于城市，将地下、地上完美融合一体化，不仅可壮大立体城市空间，而且让城市更有韧性、更包容、更宜居等（即可持续），让人与自然和谐，实现&ldquo;时间正义&rdquo;和生活更美好。未来地下空间开发环境越来越复杂，人类要科学、合理、和谐开发利用地下空间。从事地下空间开发，要始终保持敬畏之心、谦虚谨慎的态度，要坚持&ldquo;地质是基础、设备是关键、人（管理）是根本&rdquo;的风险控制原则。充分利用现代科技，深入一线实践、理论联系实际进行融合创新。持之以恒，有利于中国的地下工事顺利发展、走在世界前沿，并为人类高质量发展地下空间作出更大的贡献。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">最后，竺总祝愿林本海大师团队&ldquo;自强不息、化溥嶺南、走向世界&rdquo;。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>"}